# Everything the web app needs (index.html, lab-notes.js, lab-notes.css,
# style.css, script.js, manifest.json, image.jpg, leeticon.png, vendor/monaco)
# stays in the repo root, so the output directory is "." — this file removes
# everything that must NOT be published on the frontend domain:
#
#   - the Express backend (runs on Render, never on Vercel)
#   - the database migrations and maintenance scripts
#   - the 72 MB Android project, which contains its own copy of this web app
#   - environment files, keys, logs and build artifacts
#
# Vercel reads this at deploy time; the files are still in git for local use.

node_modules/
android-apk/
db/
scripts/
backend/
.freebuff/

server.js
render.yaml
README.md
package.json
package-lock.json
.vercelignore

.env
.env.*
*.log
keys.txt
*.apk
*.keystore
*.idsig
